OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation closed after
OL,4,Aman died on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation launched after a
OL,7,Fman died on a beach has been closed.
OL,9,FA 34-year-old man died following an
OL,10,Fincident in the water at Barmouth,
OL,11,FGwynedd, on 25 May.
OL,13,FA 24-year-old man arrested in
OL,14,Fconnection with the death has been
OL,15,Freleased with no further action, North
OL,16,FWales Police said.
OL,18,FA report into his death is being
OL,19,Fcompiled and will be submitted to the
OL,20,Fcoroner, and his family has been
OL,21,Finformed.
